{"3828230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KATAMI: A Paper Story", "steam_appid": 3828230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KATAMI: A Paper Story </strong>is a puzzle game about simply folding and cutting shapes out of paper </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is clean and considered: a sheet of paper, a target shape, a set of folds... and cut! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 chapters, each with brain bending new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of rewarding achievements for alternate solutions and clever intuitions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human-made visuals that blend digital art and handmade crafts  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original ambient soundtrack that breathes alongside every page </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of secrets waiting for attentive minds and patient hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A  story emerges from the scraps of paper!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KATAMI: A Paper Story </strong>is a puzzle game about simply folding and cutting shapes out of paper </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is clean and considered: a sheet of paper, a target shape, a set of folds... and cut! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 chapters, each with brain bending new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of rewarding achievements for alternate solutions and clever intuitions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human-made visuals that blend digital art and handmade crafts  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original ambient soundtrack that breathes alongside every page </p></li><li><p c